text:
Agents are only as good as the page they think they saw.

A tiny ✗ in a pricing table means “not included.” Flatten the page to text and it vanishes, and the agent confidently gets it wrong.

@TimSuchanek’s Expand Fetch keeps tables and icons intact and saves the page, so you can see exactly what the agent read. Pretty pretty useful! :)

